/ Portfolio text is authored in YAML and in the case editor, and it carries inline <b>, <i>
/ and <code>. Every profile field goes through the one sanitiser, so a bolded word reads as
/ bold here and on a case page rather than arriving as a literal tag on one of them.
section.pf-block.pf-block--summary
  = render TrackTagComponent.new(label: t('profile.summary'), tone: :ruby, heading: :h2)
  p.pf-summary= rich(cv.summary)
